{"seq":1,"slug":"program-design","title":"入职项目设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-framework","title":"入职框架与 30-60-90 计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design/onboarding-framework","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"codebase-ramp-up","title":"代码库快速上手","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design/codebase-ramp-up","wordCount":1539,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"culture-values-alignment","title":"文化与价值观融入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design/culture-values-alignment","wordCount":1685,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"入职项目设计\">入职项目设计</h1><p>入职项目设计解决的核心问题是：如何将「新人从零到独立产出」这段旅程从随机的、依赖个人善意的过程，变成可重复执行、可衡量结果的工程化流程。本章从三个互补的角度展开——时间框架设计（30-60-90 天该做什么）、代码库快速上手策略（如何在技术层面缩短 ramp-up）、以及文化融入（如何让新人理解并认同团队的工作方式）。</p>\n<p>三篇文档构成递进关系：框架给出整体节奏，代码库上手解决技术层面的效率问题，文化融入则确保新人不只是能写代码、而是能以正确的方式写代码。</p>\n"}